{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/parkgreen-residences-alishaan-developments-liwan","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1406,"crm_id":"7144","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Parkgreen Residences","slug":"parkgreen-residences-alishaan-developments-liwan","display_address":"Liwan","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Alishaan Developments","price":869000,"display_price":"869k","lattitude":25.101104344498,"longitude":55.368724328368,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":"1, 2, 2.5, 3","about":"<p>Parkgreen Residences by Alishaan is a residential development crafted by a new-generation Dubai developer focused on thoughtful design and long-term value. The project comprises a ground-plus-nine-floor structure offering a refined selection of <strong>1, 2, 2.5 and 3-bedroom residences</strong>, each designed with nature-inspired interiors and practical layouts.</p><p>Parkgreen Residences by Alishaan in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/liwan-dubai/\">Liwan </a>blends urban connectivity with a calm, wellness-oriented environment. Semi-furnished homes feature fully equipped kitchens, generous balconies, and high-quality finishes, while shared amenities include a swimming pool, fitness studio, co-working space, multipurpose room, and dedicated children’s facilities. With an anticipated completion in 2027, the project presents a balanced opportunity for end-users and investors seeking sustainable living in an emerging residential district.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_2cb6e316d9.jpg","hash":"Feature_2cb6e316d9","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_5ddce439e6.jpg","hash":"Banner_