:null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Developer-Led Vision - Developed by Alishaan Developments, a Dubai-based real estate company focused on quality-led residential projects with an emphasis on design integrity and long-term value creation.</li><li>Mid-Rise, Low-Density Development - A ground-plus-nine-floor structure with a limited number of residences, supporting privacy, reduced congestion, and a more controlled living environment compared to high-rise clusters.</li><li>Diverse Apartment Configurations - A well-balanced mix of 1, 2, 2.5, and 3-bedroom apartments designed to appeal to end-users, families, and rental-focused investors seeking flexibility in unit selection.</li><li>Strategic Liwan Location - Positioned in Liwan with direct access to major highways, allowing efficient connectivity to Downtown Dubai, Business Bay, DIFC, and Dubai International Airport.</li><li>Wellness-Oriented Residential Concept - Project planning emphasizes greenery, open spaces, and calm communal areas, aligning with growing demand for wellness-focused living environments in Dubai.</li><li>Semi-Furnished Residences - Apartments are delivered semi-furnished with fully equipped kitchens and integrated appliances, reducing initial setup costs for investors and owner-occupiers.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2046,"cta":{"id":2876,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/location_c225c2ecfe.jpg","hash":"location_c225c2ecfe","name":"location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"Well-Connected Living in Liwan","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Set within Liwan, Parkgreen Residences benefits from a strategic position inside <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand/\">Dubailand</a>, one of Dubai’s steadily expanding residential zones. The area is designed to support long-term urban living, combining residential communities with educational institutions, healthcare facilities, and retail destinations. The location offers direct access to major road networks, allowing seamless connectivity to Downtown Dubai, Business Bay, DIFC, and Dubai International Airport.</p><ul><li>3 minutes to Silicon Central Mall</li><li>7 minutes to GEMS FirstPoint School</li><li>10 minutes to Dubai Outlet Mall</li><li>12 minutes to Zayed University &amp; Academic City</li><li>18 minutes to Global Village</li><li>20 minutes to Downtown Dubai</li><li>22 minutes to Dubai International Airport (DXB)</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":null,"video_module":{"id":3359,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4642,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"679.9 sq.ft - 968.7 sq.ft","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/bedroom_1_54d6f4fc66.jpg","hash":"bedroom_1_54d6f4fc66","name":"bedroom-1.jpg"},"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4643,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,206.2 sq.ft - 1,521.2 sq.ft","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/bedroom_2_add7110bcd.jpg","hash":"bedroom_2_add7110bcd","name":"bedroom-2.jpg"},"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4644,"url":null,"area":null,"size":"1,490.1 sq.ft - 1,861.8 sq.ft","media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/bedroom_3_c399efe1b0.jpg","hash":"bedroom_3_c399efe1b0","name":"bedroom-3.jpg"},"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"40/60","payment_plans":[{"id":12566,"title":"20%","description":"Down Payment"},{"id":13